    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>Probe <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a> try to coax a little more range out of their sensor equipment to get that extra amount of information about the area they are scanning. A Sensor Booster is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Accessory\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid Accessory\">Droid Accessory</a> that extends the range of its sensors to a maximum of 2 kilometers, if the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sensor_Pack\" title=\"Sensor Pack\">Sensor Pack</a> installed.</p>",
